AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000146> "a two-dimensional continuant fiat boundary (surface) is a self-connected fiat surface whose location is defined in relation to some material entity. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [033-001])"@en)
